"                cũng trông như sắp trượt."
msgstr ""
"<span style=\"color:#C0392B\">▮</span> Daily energy ·\n"
"                <span style=\"color:#1F3864\">━</span> Cumulative ·\n"
"                <span style=\"color:#1a9850\">╌</span> P50 ·\n"
"                <span style=\"color:#fd8d3c\">╌</span> P75 ·\n"
"                <span style=\"color:#999\">╌</span> P90.\n"
"                The target is drawn as a cumulative line spread EVENLY across the days —\n"
"                compare the cumulative so far with the whole month's target and every\n"
"                month looks about to fall short."

